    "created_at": "2020-03-24T04:12:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-24T04:12:28Z",
    "body": "Is starship installed in `~/.local/bin`? If so, the line `export PATH=$PATH:\"$(printf \"%s:\" ${HOME}/.local/bin/*)\"` won't work, because `$HOME` refers to the home of the root user.\r\n\r\nCan you run `eval \"$(starship init zsh)\"` as root and have the prompt appear? If not, you need to fix that first.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
