    "created_at": "2020-06-05T17:47:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-05T17:47:30Z",
    "body": "Additional to this, the ROOT account default shell is BASH, and if your $USER is under ZSH and your ROOT account is BASH, you should change your ROOT shell from BASH to ZSH for you ROOT one:\r\n\r\n``` \r\nusermod --shell /bin/zsh root\r\n``` \r\n\r\nRegards.,",
